Document 7 Security threat model and controls
Threats


Local device compromise


Malicious PDF payloads


Data exfiltration via logs/telemetry


Model inversion risks if training on sensitive text


Cloud account takeover in sync phases


Controls MVP


Sandbox PDF parsing, limit file sizes, disable script execution paths.


Validate and sanitize extracted text.


No raw statement contents in logs.


Encrypted local storage.


Optional app lock (PIN/biometric).


Deterministic parsers with bounded resource usage to resist zip bombs / huge PDFs.


Controls later cloud


End-to-end encryption option for synced ledger.


Server-side rate limits and anomaly detection.


Strict PII minimization for training:


feature hashing, token redaction, merchant normalization locally before upload




Audit logs for all automated actions.



